    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have an idea or just want to support? Drop by the community!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=608 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A swordsman who relies on magic!!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Journey through the magical kingdom of Esmeraude and uncover the secrets behind Maddening Monsters. Explore beautiful landscapes and mystical caves, mastering swords and unlocking magic with your loyal flying companion, Noah.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion Puzzles</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive deep into a tale where dark forces loom and the bond between a young boy and his flying cat becomes the beacon of hope in mending the rift between humans and monsters. Together, you'll echo the ancient song of the Monster Hero.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Town Mini Games </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Companion Gameplay: Partner with Noah to challenge quirky puzzles and engage in dynamic fantasy combat.<br></li><li>Boss Fights: Each boss fight is crafted to feel and play differently!<br></li><li>Engaging Storyline: Traverse a narrative rich with heart, diving into the complexities between humans and monsters in Esmeraude.<br></li><li>Mystical Exploration: Delve into a realm teeming with magic, wonder, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.<br></li><li>A fun world to explore with tons of mini games to connect with the Monsters!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The fate of Esmeraude and its inhabitants rests on your shoulders. With monsters and humans on the brink, will you rise to the challenge and restore peace?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A swordsman who relies on magic!!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/0b12d9d10156836eedf03d0fdad93162.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Journey through the magical kingdom of Esmeraude and uncover the secrets behind Maddening Monsters. Explore beautiful landscapes and mystical caves, mastering swords and unlocking magic with your loyal flying companion, Noah.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion Puzzles</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/07076ffb470b03aeddcbc08413c24e21.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive deep into a tale where dark forces loom and the bond between a young boy and his flying cat becomes the beacon of hope in mending the rift between humans and monsters. Together, you'll echo the ancient song of the Monster Hero.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Town Mini Games </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/290f68e85b2e2570500d37398c512614.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Companion Gameplay: Partner with Noah to challenge quirky puzzles and engage in dynamic fantasy combat.<br></li><li>Boss Fights: Each boss fight is crafted to feel and play differently!<br></li><li>Engaging Storyline: Traverse a narrative rich with heart, diving into the complexities between humans and monsters in Esmeraude.<br></li><li>Mystical Exploration: Delve into a realm teeming with magic, wonder, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.<br></li><li>A fun world to explore with tons of mini games to connect with the Monsters!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.poster.avif?t=1738723155\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.webm?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582750/extras/3c5f9877b50495f470e3119347aff9ea.mp4?t=1738723155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The fate of Esmeraude and its inhabitants rests on your shoulders. With monsters and humans on the brink, will you rise to the challenge and restore peace?",
